  {
   "name": "time_projection_materialize",
   "comment": "The forward-projection reading of the time fit, materialised so OTHER seeds can match on it. Fires on either settled outcome -- an inferred orbit or the honest floor -- because the projection is defined on both: a stream with no measured structure has no measured deadline, and that is a reading, not an absence. `crossing` is the order-N generalisation of margin/rate; `order_fit` is the order it was read at. Domain-neutral: nothing here knows what the stream measures.",
   "match": [
    [
     "ag",
     "observed",
     "obs"
